---
import { EditorialSection } from '../components/EditorialSection';
import { Separator } from '../components/Separator';
import { siteData } from '../data/site';
import { BaseLayout } from '../layouts/BaseLayout';

const title = siteData.title;
const description = siteData.description;
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} bookNow={false} compactHeader={true}>
  <main class="u-container">
    <EditorialSection variants={['single']} title="Goodbye (for now)">
      <p class="u-text-4">Right then, it's been a proper good run.</p>
      <p>
        We've had some cracking tournaments and made some proper good memories together (and some
        cloudy drunken memories too).
      </p>
      <p>
        From that first tournament we put on to the last one, we've been lucky enough to see players
        from all over the world turn up, have some belting games, and make mates for life.
      </p>
      <p>
        We've watched armies smash into each other across some lovely tables, seen some proper
        tactical genius (and the odd disaster!), and celebrated everything that makes this hobby
        brilliant. Every tournament's brought new stories, new winners, and new memories we'll not
        forget in a hurry.
      </p>
      <p>
        We're having a bit of a break for now, but the Northern Kings spirit's still out there in
        every game played, every army painted, and every tournament our amazing community puts on.
        Kings of War's only getting bigger, and we're chuffed to have been part of it.
      </p>
      <p>
        To everyone who's played, sponsored us, helped out, or just turned up to watch - you've made
        Northern Kings what it was. You've shown that the best bit of this hobby isn't just the
        games, it's the folk you meet along the way.
      </p>
      <p>
        Keep rolling them dice, keep painting them miniatures, and keep the Kings of War spirit
        going. We'll see you on the battlefield again one day.
      </p>
      <Separator />
    </EditorialSection>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
